{"2597620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wall Ball", "steam_appid": 2597620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WallBall is a Single Player and Multiplayer Game Where Timing is Everything.</h2>Hit the ball just right and score big points quickly.<br>Hit the ball too early or late and suffer a painful wait as you see your opponent score points.<br>*Arcade styled game plays as fast or as slow as you play.<br>**Start in the Moon Arena and collect wins to earn different interstellar arena locations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Rhythm:</h2>When you hit the ball just right a rhythm begins to develop, much like a boxer with a speed bag, timing is everything. <br>This natural rhythm starts to speed the ball up, the question is, can you keep up and put big points on the leaderboard?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single Player:</h2>Score as many points as possible before a third out and make it to the top of the leaderboard<i>!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer:</h2>Score 21 points before your opponent to win the game<i>!</i><br>*Win 3 out of 5 games to take the match.<br>**Win 3 games in a row and put a <i>Domination Match</i> on the leaderboard.<br>***Average multiplayer game is ~45 seconds, fastest game on record is 11 seconds<i>!</i><br>****Auto-Rematch is engaged until best of 5 is reached unless a player quits.<br>*****Quitting mid-game is impossible. Quitting is only possible after game... quitter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scoring:</h2>Hit the front wall = 1 point<br>Hit the roof = 2 points<br>Hit the backstop = 3 points<br>Hit the back wall = 7 points (WALL BALL)<br>Hit the floor before front wall = Out (single player only)<br>*all combinations possible<br>**Hit 3 WallBalls in a row and put an <i>Impossible Shot</i> on the leaderboard.<br><br>Fun, fast, intensely-competitive when you want, chill when you don't.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Future, Welcome to WallBall.</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WallBall is a Single Player and Multiplayer Game Where Timing is Everything.</h2>Hit the ball just right and score big points quickly.<br>Hit the ball too early or late and suffer a painful wait as you see your opponent score points.<br>*Arcade styled game plays as fast or as slow as you play.<br>**Start in the Moon Arena and collect wins to earn different interstellar arena locations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Rhythm:</h2>When you hit the ball just right a rhythm begins to develop, much like a boxer with a speed bag, timing is everything. <br>This natural rhythm starts to speed the ball up, the question is, can you keep up and put big points on the leaderboard?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single Player:</h2>Score as many points as possible before a third out and make it to the top of the leaderboard<i>!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer:</h2>Score 21 points before your opponent to win the game<i>!</i><br>*Win 3 out of 5 games to take the match.<br>**Win 3 games in a row and put a <i>Domination Match</i> on the leaderboard.<br>***Average multiplayer game is ~45 seconds, fastest game on record is 11 seconds<i>!</i><br>****Auto-Rematch is engaged until best of 5 is reached unless a player quits.<br>*****Quitting mid-game is impossible. Quitting is only possible after game... quitter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scoring:</h2>Hit the front wall = 1 point<br>Hit the roof = 2 points<br>Hit the backstop = 3 points<br>Hit the back wall = 7 points (WALL BALL)<br>Hit the floor before front wall = Out (single player only)<br>*all combinations possible<br>**Hit 3 WallBalls in a row and put an <i>Impossible Shot</i> on the leaderboard.<br><br>Fun, fast, intensely-competitive when you want, chill when you don't.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Future, Welcome to WallBall.</h2>", "short_description": "Welcome to the Future, Welcome to WallBall.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a